{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4be62be83dadd9e19f0fcfbad494a2a9aec0c993924233f7a5a9981cdf5623ea","ja":"お疲れの一日","zh":"疲惫的一天","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"27f42ecd87b37f4c89b009d28de3e8a2459782f1ca686bff6caa6deee09d39c4","ja":"今夜のお仕事は、屋外でのイベント。ミニライブの後に\nトークショーを行うことになっていて……","zh":"今晚的工作是户外活动。在小型Live演出之后，\n还要举行脱口秀……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2fa89e4e25a5c4796451514da67ed5e7b216804cc48bb50b1dbe5a42a43d46ee","ja":"「ミニライブ、お疲れ様でした！\nトークショーまで、少し休憩していてください！」","zh":"“迷你Live辛苦了！\n在脱口秀开始前，请先稍作休息吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2c3a68ee121424ab4d6822ba5fcc3ec204b35a984413d13ec058c2015ac80bf5","ja":"ありがとうございます。\nでは、お言葉に甘えさせていただきます。","zh":"非常感谢。\n那我就恭敬不如从命了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bcc9729bda06bd7144c5f821b9c3076d686597da4194f34033ee4adff9a0dfa9","ja":"満天の星空の下でのライブ、\nなかなか得難い体験でしたね。","zh":"在漫天星空下举办的演唱会，\n真是相当难得的体验呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d7a958a206f132304e83ce0551f434354de78638a506673d43972c4fdf000b21","ja":"はい。お客さんも楽しそうでよかっ……\n…………ふわぁ～……。","zh":"是的。客人看起来也玩得挺开心，真是太好……\n…………呼啊～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e53253bf7e81a97eca9206cd6e141f84e2002b539641e2600879ab925ec75cf3","ja":"あっ……す、すみません～。\n落ち着いたら、急に眠くなってきちゃって……。","zh":"啊……对、对不起～。\n一放松下来，就突然困意上来了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9d046501ed92ab7662b1bebb66a2aea379f054340c31b313b09243d9a1c679b3","ja":"今日は朝からずっと忙しかったもんね。\n私もちょっと、眠たくなってきちゃった……。","zh":"今天从早到晚一直都好忙呢。\n我也变得有点困了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c5ec7adea52a1925bb43dd2338948510dc44e8805825fe4c98a14aedc39063e2","ja":"ちょっと、シャキッとしなさいよ。\nまだこの後に、トークショーが控えてるんだから。","zh":"喂，打起精神来啦。\n后面可还有脱口秀在等着呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0d0cb3f386584d63670ef79da55821d43104889ab82fb77fdb169c88524579b4","ja":"そ、そうだよね。ごめんごめん。トークショー中に\nうとうとしないように、気をつけなきゃ。","zh":"也、也是呢。抱歉抱歉。脱口秀期间\n我得注意一点，不能打瞌睡才行。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"60a0ff5ddd343acc08ccdc5c26ecec5b327b978f39af6e9a48cdef69e2643bd8","ja":"もし眠くなったら、その場で小さく\n足踏みするといいわ。少しは、頭がすっきりするわよ。","zh":"要是犯困了，不妨在原地轻轻地\n踏步试试。头脑多少会清醒一些哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"63f3f8c41008d0948dede18000a3f7ba2a6c1513e97619a1e0e08dadc4e0780d","ja":"そのときは試してみるね。\nあとは……今のうちにガムを噛むとかかな？","zh":"到时候我试试看吧。\n还有就是……趁现在嚼嚼口香糖之类的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"09e5cdac5c382fcb6d196df758afe521d4d6355304a0160421a405f56493b01a","ja":"スタッフさんから、もらったのがあるよ。","zh":"有从工作人员那里拿到的东西哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"bf17657b1d78dc582c95931388c691b3809b8397802b0d2bc6c4dd4ddd25d149","ja":"あ、もらってもいい？\n眠気覚まし、しておかないと……。","zh":"啊，能给我一点吗？\n得提提神才行……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"5ece02be012de5ae9f7c70d60079405a4a407de492b05e17349252eb402fd17e","ja":"四条さんもいりますか？","zh":"四条小姐也需要吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"41f36c8921d82d2842d04927aaf8d988def2f3ef6fdb0546cf42ee862b238792","ja":"私は大丈夫です。残すはとーくしょーのみ。\n見事、乗り越えてみせましょう。","zh":"我没关系的。剩下的只有脱口秀了。\n就漂亮地克服给您看吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"5167fa8b577dbfffb4278b230e723da2efcfda2ec3a90660b387d1d7ae45c8e5","ja":"何かあったときは、私にお任せください。\nいつ何時でも、皆をさぽーといたします。","zh":"要是发生了什么事，就请交给我吧。\n无论何时何地，我都会全力支持大家。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
